Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.81,0:00:06.18,TL,,0,0,0,,在同一站比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:08.17,TL,,0,0,0,,先后击败纳达尔和费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:10.04,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 有一份官方名单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:12.18,TL,,0,0,0,,做到过的人一共只有{\fs78}6{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.99,TL,,0,0,0,,达维登科 德尔波特罗 德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.74,TL,,0,0,0,,穆雷 纳班迪安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.76,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一个 是大卫 戈芬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.52,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68} 月 {\fs78}22{\fs68} 日
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.07,TL,,0,0,0,,他在家乡布鲁塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:26.00,TL,,0,0,0,,打完了职业生涯的最后一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:30.19,TL,,0,0,0,,故事从一个递补名额开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:31.92,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2012{\fs68} 年法网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:34.65,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}21{\fs68} 岁的戈芬排名第 {\fs78}109{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:36.36,TL,,0,0,0,,资格赛已经出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:37.60,TL,,0,0,0,,孟菲尔斯退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:40.59,TL,,0,0,0,,他以幸运落败者的身份递补进正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:44.11,TL,,0,0,0,,连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}轮 第四轮站到了费德勒对面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:47.41,TL,,0,0,0,,他的卧室墙上 贴满了费德勒的海报
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.41,0:00:50.28,TL,,0,0,0,,那一天 他从偶像手里抢下第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:51.84,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘只差两分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:53.75,TL,,0,0,0,,就能取得两盘领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:00:57.09,TL,,0,0,0,,他的个子 在男子网球里不占优势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.09,0:00:59.61,TL,,0,0,0,,他靠的是抢点 站进场内
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.61,0:01:02.37,TL,,0,0,0,,把球打得比所有人早半步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:12.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}All the walls of my bedroom were full of posters of Roger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我卧室的墙上 贴满了罗杰的海报
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:18.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was like a dream for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那感觉 就像做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:21.81,TL,,0,0,0,,手术之后 他从头爬起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.21,0:01:23.42,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2013{\fs68} 年底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:24.96,TL,,0,0,0,,他动了手腕手术
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:26.94,TL,,0,0,0,,排名掉出{\fs78}100{\fs68}名开外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:28.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2014{\fs68} 年夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.12,TL,,0,0,0,,他打出一波 {\fs78}25{\fs68} 连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:32.35,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下生涯第一个巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:35.87,TL,,0,0,0,,年底当选 {\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 年度最佳复出球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.21,0:01:39.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.81,TL,,0,0,0,,他还把比利时带进戴维斯杯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:44.81,TL,,0,0,0,,两场单打全赢 球队还是输了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:46.97,TL,,0,0,0,,离冠军差一步 这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:48.91,TL,,0,0,0,,后来反复发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.21,0:01:55.79,TL,,0,0,0,,上升最陡的那一年 意外来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:01:59.69,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年 是他上升最陡的一年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:00.87,TL,,0,0,0,,法网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:02.95,TL,,0,0,0,,他第一盘 {\fs78}5{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}4{\fs68} 领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:04.69,TL,,0,0,0,,追球冲向场底时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:07.36,TL,,0,0,0,,他的右脚卡进了卷起的防水苫布
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.47,TL,,0,0,0,,整个人撞上围墙 被扶着下了场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:11.75,TL,,0,0,0,,核磁没有骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:15.03,TL,,0,0,0,,可整个草地赛季就这样报销
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.21,0:02:18.87,TL,,0,0,0,,纳达尔当时就说过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.87,0:02:22.27,TL,,0,0,0,,那块苫布的位置 一直很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:27.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there it is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:30.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He has captured his first ATP 500 title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下生涯首个 {\fs78}500{\fs68} 级别冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:33.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}his second title of 2017, his fourth career title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年第二冠 生涯第四冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:34.69,TL,,0,0,0,,而他这一生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:37.80,TL,,0,0,0,,离最大的两个冠军都只差一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:39.77,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年总决赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:42.10,TL,,0,0,0,,他输给迪米特洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:46.36,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2019{\fs68} 年辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.36,0:02:48.29,TL,,0,0,0,,他唯一一次大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:50.36,TL,,0,0,0,,输给梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:55.32,TL,,0,0,0,,同一年 他接连赢下三巨头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:57.65,TL,,0,0,0,,但 {\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年剩下的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:02:59.28,TL,,0,0,0,,他全抢了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:01.06,TL,,0,0,0,,那年 {\fs78}4{\fs68} 月的蒙特卡洛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:04.23,TL,,0,0,0,,他对德约科维奇此前五战全败
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.23,0:03:06.61,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次决胜盘 {\fs78}2{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}4{\fs68} 落后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.61,0:03:08.49,TL,,0,0,0,,他硬是翻了盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:12.20,TL,,0,0,0,,第五个赛点 终于兑现 他说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:15.13,TL,,0,0,0,,这是我生涯最佳的一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a fantastic win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场梦幻般的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:21.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The best win of my career for sure.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是我生涯最好的一场胜利 千真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.35,0:03:23.95,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68} 月伦敦总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:26.29,TL,,0,0,0,,小组赛他赢了世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:28.12,TL,,0,0,0,,那一场纳达尔膝伤缠身
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.25,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后退出了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.85,0:03:35.08,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 他又逆转了费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:38.32,TL,,0,0,0,,此前{\fs78}6{\fs68}次交手 他全败 他说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.57,TL,,0,0,0,,这是我生涯最佳的一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.40,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1000{\fs68}真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:46.39,TL,,0,0,0,,同一句话 同一年 他说了两次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:49.32,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 他把德约科维奇 纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:51.58,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒挨个赢了一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:53.62,TL,,0,0,0,,同一年里通杀三巨头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:55.18,TL,,0,0,0,,整个三巨头时代
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:57.49,TL,,0,0,0,,也没几个人做到过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:02.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was the best moment to do it,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在这样的观众面前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:06.30,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in front of such a nice crowd.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没有比这更好的时机了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:12.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}To beat Roger was something unbelievable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能击败罗杰 简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:16.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's such a legend.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是一个传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:19.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's my idol since I'm really young.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是我从小的偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:22.55,TL,,0,0,0,,很多人以为 他就此沉寂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:25.63,TL,,0,0,0,,故事没有在 {\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:28.66,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68} 年 他第二次赢下纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:30.26,TL,,0,0,0,,他说过 打拉法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:33.40,TL,,0,0,0,,你必须把球抢得更早 多冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:36.58,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68} 年阿斯塔纳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:37.96,TL,,0,0,0,,资格赛出局的他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.93,TL,,0,0,0,,又以幸运落败者的身份递补进正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:42.67,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是刚拿下美网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:44.82,TL,,0,0,0,,刚登上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}的阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:46.62,TL,,0,0,0,,他直落两盘赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:48.20,TL,,0,0,0,,两次从替补席出发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.57,TL,,0,0,0,,中间隔了整整{\fs78}10{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was a tough three years.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这三年很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:57.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I still have the fire inside me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我心里的火 还在烧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:05:00.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Today, I couldn't handle his pressure.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯 这压力 我扛不住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:02.66,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68} 年上海
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:06.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}33{\fs68} 岁的他赢下兹维列夫 打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.65,0:05:10.18,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68} 年迈阿密 {\fs78}34{\fs68} 岁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.54,TL,,0,0,0,,他又一次逆转阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:14.04,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯后来承认
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:16.08,TL,,0,0,0,,他上一次为网球掉眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:19.15,TL,,0,0,0,,就是那年在迈阿密输给戈芬之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.58,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一站 他选在家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:25.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68} 年 膝伤让他决定停下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:28.28,TL,,0,0,0,,告别站选在家乡布鲁塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:30.22,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮决胜盘 {\fs78}0{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}3{\fs68} 落后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:32.65,TL,,0,0,0,,他又抢了回来 赛后还开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.65,0:05:35.96,TL,,0,0,0,,订好的告别派对 怕是要取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:41.07,TL,,0,0,0,,第二天 最后一场 他输了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:44.37,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一个回球下网 全场起立
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:48.95,TL,,0,0,0,,大屏幕上 纳达尔第一个出现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:51.52,TL,,0,0,0,,祝贺他了不起的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:54.23,TL,,0,0,0,,他站在场中央 哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Hello, David. How are you doing, man?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N纳达尔 大卫 你好吗 老兄？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:01.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I just want to congratulate you on your amazing career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N祝贺你这段了不起的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:05.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It has been a huge pleasure to share practices and matches,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能和你一起训练 一起比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:08.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and great moments together on the tour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N分享巡回赛的美好时刻 是荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}David! This video is to congratulate you{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N加斯奎特 大卫！这段视频
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:12.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}on your great career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是为了祝贺你伟大的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:14.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It has been an honour to share this time with you.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能与你共度这段时光 是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:17.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You are truly an extraordinary person.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你是一个真正了不起的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:18.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Congratulations on your incredible career{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N迪米特洛夫 祝贺你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and amazing journey, my dear friend.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这段不可思议的旅程 我亲爱的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you for sharing the court with me for so many years.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢你这么多年与我共享球场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:27.15,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}358{\fs68} 场胜利 {\fs78}6{\fs68} 个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:28.28,TL,,0,0,0,,他在赛后说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.54,TL,,0,0,0,,我为我的整个职业生涯自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:33.72,TL,,0,0,0,,我没有遗憾 我拼到了最后一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:42.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I am proud of my whole career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我为我的整个职业生涯自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:51.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I have no regrets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我没有遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:07:03.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I gave it my all, right to the end.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我拼到了最后一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:06.66,TL,,0,0,0,,没有大满贯 没有大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.06,TL,,0,0,0,,最高只到第 {\fs78}7{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:11.32,TL,,0,0,0,,这样的职业生涯 算不算成功？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:16.91,TL,,0,0,0,,这样的生涯 算成功吗？
